OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of inciting unrest but acquitted
OL,5,Aof treason
OL,6,
OL,7,FTanzania's main opposition leader,
OL,8,FTundu Lissu, has been found guilty of
OL,9,Finciting unrest and sentenced to four
OL,10,Fyears in jail, in a case that has
OL,11,Fraised concerns about political freedom
OL,12,Fin the East African country.
OL,14,FA panel of three judges at the High
OL,15,FCourt in Dar es Salaam acquitted him of
OL,16,Fthe more serious offence of treason,
OL,17,Fsaying prosecutors had failed to prove
OL,18,Fa key element of that charge.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
