OL,3,ATanzanian opposition leader found
OL,4,Aguilty of inciting unrest but acquitted
OL,5,Aof treason
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut they said the 58-year-old, who has
OL,8,Fbeen detained since April last year,
OL,9,Fhad encouraged his supporters to
OL,10,Fdisrupt the disputed 2025 general
OL,11,Felection.
OL,13,FLissu, who leads the opposition Chadema
OL,14,Fparty, has denied the charges,
OL,15,Fdescribing the prosecution as
OL,16,Fpolitically motivated.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
